{"id":"torrey:daily-sacrifice-the","source":"torrey","name":"Daily Sacrifice, The","slug":"daily-sacrifice-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Ordained in mount Sinai — Nu 28:6.","refs":[["Num",28,6,28,6]]},{"text":"A lamb as a burnt offering morning and evening — Ex 29:38,39; Nu 28:3,4.","refs":[["Exod",29,38,29,38],["Exod",29,39,29,39],["Num",28,3,28,3],["Num",28,4,28,4]]},{"text":"Doubled on the sabbath — Nu 28:9,10.","refs":[["Num",28,9,28,9],["Num",28,10,28,10]]},{"text":"With a meat and drink offering. — Ex 29:40,41; Nu 28:5-8.","refs":[["Exod",29,40,29,40],["Exod",29,41,29,41],["Num",28,5,28,8]]},{"text":"Slowly and entirely consumed. — Le 6:9-12.","refs":[["Lev",6,9,6,12]]},{"text":"Perpetually observed. — Ex 29:42; Nu 28:3,6.","refs":[["Exod",29,42,29,42],["Num",28,3,28,3],["Num",28,6,28,6]]},{"text":"Peculiarly acceptable — Nu 28:8; Ps 141:2.","refs":[["Num",28,8,28,8],["Ps",141,2,141,2]]},{"text":"Secured God’s presence and favour — Ex 29:43,44.","refs":[["Exod",29,43,29,43],["Exod",29,44,29,44]]},{"text":"Times of offering, were seasons of prayer — Ezr 9:5; Da 9:20,21; Ac 3:1.","refs":[["Ezra",9,5,9,5],["Dan",9,20,9,20],["Dan",9,21,9,21],["Acts",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Restored after the captivity — Ezr 3:3.","refs":[["Ezra",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"The abolition of, foretold — Da 9:26,27; 11:31.","refs":[["Dan",9,26,9,26],["Dan",9,27,9,27],["Dan",11,31,11,31]]},{"text":"Christ. — Joh 1:29,36; 1Pe 1:19.","refs":[["John",1,29,1,29],["John",1,36,1,36],["1Pet",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Acceptable prayer. — Ps 141:2.","refs":[["Ps",141,2,141,2]]}],"refCount":30}
